{"posts":[{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_876","t":"hi guys\n\nstill rading and learning the CP, but wanted to try my first shot\n\nthx in advance for ur comments","a":"ag77","d":"","n":"#876","p":36,"im":["f7a7cccb80792083b1e84944b2e7192ffc7f8a62"],"m":876},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_877","t":"Away\n\nHi ag77,\n\nFor a first go, this is excellent, I have left a few remarks on the chart for you, but one thing I would recommend is going through each individual concept and learn them inside out, things will start becoming clearer for you! There is so much information here to get you started, good luck!\n\nAaron","a":"Aaron","d":"","n":"#877","p":36,"im":["ed49f9b7f9510e3e1aaa1e66cdea138f63094c68"],"m":877},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_878","t":"ag77 wrote: hi guys\n\nstill rading and learning the CP, but wanted to try my first shot\n\nthx in advance for ur comments\n\nyour FLs are ok btw. some of the cp you mark on the wrong end\n\nEdit: thanks Aaron","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#878","p":36,"im":["5a0f7de5bf4861992e7a3114ef72a196c04a1f27"],"m":878},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_879","t":"tyvvm Aaron & Harry\n\nwill work on it and shoot anothwer chart soon","a":"ag77","d":"","n":"#879","p":36,"im":[],"m":879},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_880","t":"Hello. I tried to find compression. I read about it but I didn't understand how it exactly playes role in trading.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#880","p":36,"im":["3a49811fd86cf7ae19688087e91661a3cc28ca65"],"m":880},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_881","t":"milkeyway wrote: Hello. I tried to find compression. I read about it but I didn't understand how it exactly playes role in trading.\n\nCompression (CP) shows us that there is no fresh demand or supply left in CP zone which means that if price make an engulf it could easily go to the other side of CP","a":"Victor","d":"","n":"#881","p":36,"im":["3dd0366a1bd9907c566ee4119ae611ded76a150a"],"m":881},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_882","t":"Victor wrote:\n\nmilkeyway wrote: Hello. I tried to find compression. I read about it but I didn't understand how it exactly playes role in trading.\n\nThanks. Keep me informing like this so I can understand how these concepts plays role.:)","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#882","p":36,"im":[],"m":882},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_883","t":"hello again\n\nlooks to me like a really good example of cp to HTF (4hrs) supply.\n\nas of now i can rcognize it only after, hopefully soon ill be able to see it before...","a":"ag77","d":"","n":"#883","p":36,"im":["320069b2eb1c76c2ee56cee8c4d13256ce9ec016"],"m":883},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_884","t":"ag77 wrote: hello again\n\nlooks to me like a really good example of cp to HTF (4hrs) supply.\n\nas of now i can rcognize it only after, hopefully soon ill be able to see it before...\n\nag77,\n\nThat is the first step, OOOH i love this. Go and look in my psychology thread. Read \"the Four stages of learning\"\n\nYou are on the right path.\n\nEveryone on this forum is somewhere in stage 1 - 4, important to know where you are.","a":"Warren","d":"","n":"#884","p":36,"im":["320069b2eb1c76c2ee56cee8c4d13256ce9ec016"],"m":884},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_885","t":"ag77 wrote: hello again\n\nlooks to me like a really good example of cp to HTF (4hrs) supply.\n\nas of now i can rcognize it only after, hopefully soon ill be able to see it before...\n\nmmm.... nope try again after reading from the start of this thread. there are many excellent examples posted already that will help you get a better picture.","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#885","p":36,"im":[],"m":885},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_886","t":"Is this correct?","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#886","p":36,"im":["24d6e29842b3c88535ef0bb651925d5779031265"],"fa":"آیا این درست است؟","m":886},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_887","t":"Away\n\nWell done mate! You have the idea\n\nI may be being picky here, but this is what I am training myself to be, that way I don't get into trades that I am not 100% sure with! I found a small untested demand in your CP, all the rest looks great!","a":"Aaron","d":"","n":"#887","p":36,"im":["d1c2440db808ed1b24807e132beb202718a683a3"],"m":887},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_888","t":"Hi Milkeyway\n\nI see Aaron has replied to you already. But since I had made comments on your chart I decided to post anyway,\n\nIt's part of my learning as well.\n\nRegards In2forex","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#888","p":36,"im":["20bb951ebb0b2fa0a26a6e0d036fcf225c06ac5e"],"m":888},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_889","t":"More charts\n\nMy main focus at the moment is on compression, so that's why I'm posting my charts here, but as you can see I'm marking other things on the charts. I believe how the pieces of price action fit together will tell the story of where price has been and where it is going.\n\nLTF","a":"in2forex","d":"","n":"#889","p":36,"im":["dce8bd0150efcba5ee3dd354d01d03f80e7f9010","864679ca44a7122a44a19ea5f9a7462d4a3eddfe"],"m":889},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_890","t":"another chart, hope its getting better...\n\nthx again for ur comments, have a grate weekend!!!","a":"ag77","d":"","n":"#890","p":36,"im":["1c8903f5d5ec037b1a6e68ca231a2382edbbe2cc"],"m":890},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_891","t":"Away\n\nSuper stuff Bud!\n\nGreat work\n\nThere is only one place I would not have marked CP, some traders may agree or disagree, just my opinion","a":"Aaron","d":"","n":"#891","p":36,"im":["732069e6ce809128eaf99cf8e2c273f481686e49"],"m":891},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_892","t":"Yip look pretty good to me ag77, except maybe for that little pocket of demand I marked (but I am being picky).","a":"DrSwing","d":"","n":"#892","p":36,"im":["7b195455b9df5396439f67858678d423485f72b4"],"m":892},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_893","t":"tyhx again aaron an Dr swing\n\nbeing piccky is good Doc, donno how i didnt notice it, but it made quite a jump out of that pocket","a":"ag77","d":"","n":"#893","p":36,"im":["5990493d4e9ce49f16617ab8bb21eb7337e354f6"],"m":893},{"id":"aboutcompression_p36_894","t":"Hi All\n\nAnother char